OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for unprovoked murder
OL,4,Aof family man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been sentenced to at least 27
OL,7,Fyears in prison for stabbing a a
OL,8,F55-year old man to death in a park in
OL,9,FCamden, north London.
OL,11,FMark Carroll died after an unprovoked
OL,12,Fattack by Rasheed Rahman, 21, in St
OL,13,FMartin's Gardens on 10 April May 2024.
OL,15,FRahman previously denied murder, but
OL,16,Fwas found guilty following a trial at
OL,17,FWood Green Crown Court. He as also
OL,18,Fconvicted of carrying a knife,
OL,19,Fthreatening with an offensive weapon
OL,20,Fand robbery.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
