OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for unprovoked murder
OL,4,Aof family man
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing sentencing on Thursday,
OL,7,FCarroll's daughters Danielle and Ayisha
OL,8,Fsaid: "Our Dad was a loving father and
OL,9,Fa devoted grandfather who meant the
OL,10,Fworld to his family. While our family
OL,11,Fis relieved by today's sentence, it
OL,12,Fdoes not bring our dad back."
